# Goryo's Vengeance spliced onto We Say Thee Nay! (CR 702.47) has a target slot of its own after the host's: Bot1 answers Bot2's Lightning Bolt with
# the spliced spell targeting the Bolt and its entombed Headliner Scarlett. Bot2 then exiles the Scarlett with Ghost Vacuum. One of
# the spell's targets is gone but the Bolt is still legal (CR 608.2b), so the spell resolves: it does what it can for the
# Bolt (countered unless its caster pays {2}, which Bot2 cannot) and the spliced Goryo's text, whose only target is gone,
# does nothing - no creature returns.

